        <mxCell id="v173" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Legend: blue dashed = control · green = application SQL · orange = transaction flow · orange dashed = replica bootstrap&lt;br/&gt;Replicas initiate TCP/3306 connections to the current primary. Group Replication stays within each MySQL cluster.&lt;br/&gt;Each member uses its own oci-bv PVC (10Gi request). Initial roles are shown; scripts 31/32 can change the primary cluster/member." style="fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial;fontColor=#312D2A;text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;">
